					"content": "我們盡力而為。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721402011
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721402009,
					"content": "#沒關係，我們也會幫忙的，對吧？{NICKNAME}？",
